# Certain IP ranges should never be contacted

It is possible someone could get cute with hostnames. So, reject packets
destined for the IPv4 link-local range 169.254.0.0/16 or the IPv6 link-local
range fe80::/10. Localhost traffic remains inside the sandbox. 

Also, block fd00:ec2::254, and fd20:ce::254 for cloud metadata.

